Okta Security published the root cause and remediation. Cloudflare, 1Password and BeyondTrust each published their own account, and the page says that transparency is why this incident is teachable at all. The MITRE page defines T1550.004, Use Alternate Authentication Material: Web Session Cookie, the technique behind stage 03.

The background slides name their own sources: the csoh.org glossary and the OWASP Session Management Cheat Sheet.

